      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need to comply with the CCPA if I am not in California?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Location does not exempt you. The test is whether you do business in California and meet a threshold. A company anywhere in the world that markets to and collects data from California residents at sufficient scale is covered. There is no physical presence requirement."
